<!-- ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
     WARUM FREISING  (dark)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━ -->
<section class="bg-zinc-950 py-28 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute top-1/2 right-0 -translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[500px]
              bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_right,rgba(249,115,22,.08)_0%,transparent_65%)]"></div>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">

    <div class="reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/20
                text-orange-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[2.5px]
                px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6">
      Warum Freising?
    </div>

    <h2 class="reveal reveal-d1 font-black text-white leading-tight
               text-4xl sm:text-5xl mb-14 max-w-xl">
      Lokaler Fokus.<br/>
      <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 to-amber-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
        Echter Vorteil.
      </span>
    </h2>

    <!-- Bento grid -->
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">

      <!-- Wide top-left -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-d1 lg:col-span-2
                  bg-white/[.04] border border-white/[.07]
                  hover:border-orange-500/25 hover:bg-white/[.06]
                  rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-5">📍</span>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">
          Nur Malerbetriebe in Freising &amp; Umgebung
        </h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">
          Mein Fokus liegt ausschließlich auf Malerbetrieben in dieser Region –
          deshalb kenne ich den Markt, die Konkurrenz und eure Zielgruppe genau.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          {['Freising','Moosburg','Erding','Mainburg','Landshut','München Nord'].map(o => (
            <span class="text-xs text-zinc-600 border border-zinc-800 px-3 py-1 rounded-full
                         hover:border-orange-500/40 hover:text-zinc-400 transition-colors cursor-default">
              {o}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Solid orange card -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-d2
                  bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-orange-600
                  rounded-2xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between
                  shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(249,115,22,.3)]">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-4">⚡</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-lg mb-3">First Mover gewinnt</h3>
          <p class="text-orange-100 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Die meisten Mitbewerber haben noch keinen aktiven Online-Auftritt.
            Wer jetzt anfängt, baut einen Vorsprung, den andere kaum aufholen.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-orange-400/40">
          <p class="text-white font-black text-2xl">Jetzt.</p>
          <p class="text-orange-200/70 text-xs mt-0.5">ist der richtige Zeitpunkt</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom left -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-d3
                  bg-white/[.04] border border-white/[.07]
                  hover:border-orange-500/25 hover:bg-white/[.06]
                  rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-3xl block mb-4">🔍</span>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Ich kenne den Markt</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
