          Kein generisches Marketing – Strategie für Freising.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom right wide -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-d4 sm:col-span-2
                  bg-white/[.04] border border-white/[.07]
                  hover:border-orange-500/25 hover:bg-white/[.06]
                  rounded-2xl p-8 flex items-center gap-6
                  transition-all duration-300">
        <span class="text-4xl shrink-0">🤝</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-2">Exklusiv – kein Konkurrenzkonflikt</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
